REUSE OF THIS LICENSE TEXT

The text of the FL License is made available as a reusable template.
Anyone may copy, reproduce, and distribute this license text verbatim
for use in their own projects, subject to three conditions:

  1. The license text is reproduced in full without alteration to its terms.
  2. The copyright notice ("Copyright (c) [year] [name]") is replaced with
     the copyright notice of the party adopting it for their own project.
  3. Adoption of this license creates no relationship, obligation, or
     liability between the adopting party and Jayden Emmanuel.

Jayden Emmanuel makes no warranties about the suitability of this license
for any particular purpose. Adopters do so at their own risk.

HOW TO ADOPT THIS LICENSE

To adopt the FL License for your own project, simply include the full text of this license in a file named "LICENSE" in the root directory of your project. Replace the copyright notice at the top with your own copyright information. You may also include a reference to this license in your project's documentation or source code files as appropriate.

Reference in source code files can be done by including a comment block at the top of each file, such as:

```cpp
// Copyright (c) [year] [name].
// Licensed under the FL License. See LICENSE.txt for details.
```
